---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Louis | Louis the History Goose">
  <section class="about-hero container">

    <div class="about-box">
      <img class="goose-image" src="/public/Louis_goose.png" alt="Louis the History Goose" />
      </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>Louis the History Goose is a blog for the stranger, forgotten, surprising, and sometimes ridiculous sides of history.</p>
      <p>The goal is simple: make history entertaining and approachable, rather than something that feels like a school textbook. Every story is a small invitation to get curious, follow a weird detail, and see the past from a new angle.</p>
      <p>Louis is the blog's playful guide through the mess: part narrator, part archivist, part bird with strong opinions about the 18th century.</p>
    </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
